sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant Flow as Flow Action
    participant DT as Data Transform
    participant WO as pyWorkPage
    participant Eng as Pega Engine
    participant DB as Database

    User->>Flow: Submit Assignment
    Flow->>DT: Pre-processing DT
    DT->>WO: Set / Map properties
    Flow->>Eng: Commit Assignments
    Eng->>WO: Validate (Validate rules)
    Eng->>DB: Obj-Save (pc_work table)
    DB-->>Eng: pxCommitDateTime updated
    Eng->>Eng: Advance Flow
    Eng-->>User: Next screen / confirmation
